WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:11.480
I'm not leaving Puerto Rico. I'm Dr. José Rodríguez, a board-certified cardiologist.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.200
I have options in the States. But money isn't what drives me.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.960
These are my patients. This is my island.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.480
I was born here, raised here, and I'll be buried here.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.520
This is my vocation. My passion.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.440
We pay the same Medicare payroll tax rate.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:36.280
Yet our benchmarks are 40% below the national average, 20% below the Virgin Islands.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:42.280
Medicare's own ratings show exceptional quality: five-star care, two-star payments.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.400
Stop penalizing performance.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.520
Secretary Kennedy, one solution.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:54.720
Establish an AGA floor of 0.70 across Puerto Rico for 2028.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:58.200
Use your administrative authority. Act now.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:06.300
Find us on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Amazon Music, iHeartRadio and YouTube, wherever you get your podcasts.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.600
The Healthcare Paradox starts now.
